      place IS A Place
      `the date the offence was committed` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE Penalty
`the penalty subsection: what may follow conviction` `the longest term of imprisonment on conviction on indictment, in years` place `the date the offence was committed` MEANS
    -- NOTHING: section 15(2) says sections 1 to 9 and 11 to 13 extend to England and Wales and
    -- Northern Ireland only, so for any other place the Act states no penalty.
    IF `section 15(2): sections 1 to 9 and 11 to 13 extend to` place
    THEN JUST (Penalty WITH
                  `on summary conviction, imprisonment for a term not exceeding` IS `sections 1(3)(a), 6(2)(a), 7(2)(a), 9(6)(a) and 11(3)(a): the longest term on summary conviction` place `the date the offence was committed`
                  `on summary conviction, a fine not exceeding` IS `the statutory maximum (the Act states no figure)`
                  `on conviction on indictment, imprisonment for a term not exceeding, in years` IS `the longest term of imprisonment on conviction on indictment, in years`
                  `on conviction on indictment, a fine not exceeding` IS `no limit is stated`
                  `imprisonment and a fine may both be imposed` IS TRUE)
